  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Welcome to Sleepy Bee!</strong></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">We are here to help you begin your eco-friendly journey as parents, carers, and guardians, educating and providing you with the tools needed to practice a plastic-free lifestyle without breaking the bank.&nbsp;&nbsp;With our signatures materials ranging from Organic Bamboo and GOTS certified Organic Cotton to Food Grade Silicon on our weaning products, we have gone above and beyond to create products that are long-lasting and sustainable, without using plastic. This is true from the beginning of our products lifecycle starting with the design phase where our products are created with a minimalist and modern approach. This ethos is embedded throughout our<span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp;supply chain, from manufacturing and production,&nbsp;right to delivering the products to your door.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleepy Bee was initiated, designed, and created during the bleakest time in our human history. Launching a brand during the midst of a pandemic is challenging, but if 2021 has taught us anything, it's shown us how the health of our bodies and our planet are central to human happiness.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">With that being said, at Sleepy Bee we have outlined our key ethos below. It is these values that the brand has been built upon and will continue to live by.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding-left: 2rem;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleepy Bee works with certified standard suppliers for all products</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleepy Bee ensures all packaging is recyclable and waste is minimized</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleepy Bee aims to become a B Corporation</span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sleepy Bee will ensure that the health and safety of children is always put first</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">For every product you choose from Sleepy Bee, you will be making this world a better place for your little one by supporting sustainability and slow living.</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product Description:</p>\r\n<p>Sleepy Bee focus on modern design, sustainable practices, and eco-friendly products for both children and parents to benefit from. More than ever parents want to ensure their children have a beautiful environment and world to grow up in (ourselves included). And that is why at Sleepy Bee, we create products that are natural, organic, and well-made to support the development of happy and healthy babies.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): IG Reels, Facebook, Online Ads</p>",
